  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Variable window is resizable by dragging right-bottom corner. But\n* There is not clear visible hint informing that it's resizable.\n* Cursor icon is still \"arrow\" when mouse cursor is on most right-bottom, though it's in draggable region.\n(see 1st image)\n--- Details\nUCS values are inappropriate.\n1. Suitable image is not set to resizer-icon element. (see 2nd image)\n2. resizer-icon's cursor is Arrow. (see 3rd image)\n(Those style values are coded in GraphViewEditor/Manipulators/Resizer.cs)\nSo I suggest something like this:\nUdonGraphStyle.uss:\n```\n#Parameters > Resizer .resizer-icon {\n\tbackground-image: resource(\"CornerResize\");\n\tcursor: resize-up-left;\n}\n```\nResizer style.paddingTop is hardcoded as 14.\nSo you'll need adjust after constructing \"variable window\" (Blackboard class) \n```\n   var resizer = _blackboard.Q<Resizer>();\n   resizer.style.paddingTop = 10;\n```\nThen it will be like 4th image.",
